{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"13423209","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209","key":"KAFKA-13598","fields":{"summary":"idempotence producer is not enabled by default if not set explicitly","resolutiondate":"2022-02-07T17:58:30.035+0000","created":"2022-01-18T08:53:17.870+0000","description":"In KAFKA-10619, we intended to enable idempotence by default, but this was not achieved due to a bug in the config validation logic. The change from acks=1 to acks=all worked correctly, however.\r\n\r\nThis is the following up for KIP-679: [https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-679%3A+Producer+will+enable+the+strongest+delivery+guarantee+by+default]\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNote: In KAFKA-13673, we'll disable idempotent producer when acks/retries/max.in.flight config conflicts, to avoid breaking existing producers.","issuelinks":[{"id":"12631793","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issueLink/12631793","type":{"id":"12310660","name":"Completes","inward":"is fixed by","outward":"fixes","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/12310660"},"outwardIssue":{"id":"13421888","key":"KAFKA-13589","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13421888","fields":{"summary":"fix flaky `PlaintextAdminIntegrationTest.testReplicaCanFetchFromLogStartOffsetAfterDeleteRecords` test","status":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/status/5","description":"A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png","name":"Resolved","id":"5","statusCategory":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/statuscategory/3","id":3,"key":"done","colorName":"green","name":"Done"}},"priority":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/priorities/major.svg","name":"Major","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issuetype/6","id":"6","description":"A new unit, integration or system test.","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/issuetypes/requirement.png","name":"Test","subtask":false}}}},{"id":"12634001","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issueLink/12634001","type":{"id":"10030","name":"Reference","inward":"is related to","outward":"relates to","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/10030"},"outwardIssue":{"id":"13429003","key":"KAFKA-13673","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13429003","fields":{"summary":"disable idempotent producer when acks/retries/max.in.flight config conflicts","status":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/status/5","description":"A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png","name":"Resolved","id":"5","statusCategory":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/statuscategory/3","id":3,"key":"done","colorName":"green","name":"Done"}},"priority":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/priorities/major.svg","name":"Major","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issuetype/4","id":"4","description":"An improvement or enhancement to an existing feature or task.","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=21140&avatarType=issuetype","name":"Improvement","subtask":false,"avatarId":21140}}}},{"id":"12633518","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issueLink/12633518","type":{"id":"10030","name":"Reference","inward":"is related to","outward":"relates to","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/10030"},"inwardIssue":{"id":"13336139","key":"KAFKA-10619","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13336139","fields":{"summary":"Enable producer idempotence by default (KIP-679)","status":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/status/5","description":"A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png","name":"Resolved","id":"5","statusCategory":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/statuscategory/3","id":3,"key":"done","colorName":"green","name":"Done"}},"priority":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/priorities/major.svg","name":"Major","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issuetype/4","id":"4","description":"An improvement or enhancement to an existing feature or task.","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=21140&avatarType=issuetype","name":"Improvement","subtask":false,"avatarId":21140}}}}],"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17477963","id":"17477963","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ijuma","name":"ijuma","key":"ijuma","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Ismael Juma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"body":"[~showuon] it would be good to determine if this is a 3.1.0 blocker. cc [~dajac] [~kirktrue]","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ijuma","name":"ijuma","key":"ijuma","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Ismael Juma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"created":"2022-01-18T15:13:31.980+0000","updated":"2022-01-18T15:13:31.980+0000"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17478086","id":"17478086","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dajac","name":"dajac","key":"dajac","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"David Jacot","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich"},"body":"That seems to be a bug and not a regression introduced in 3.1 so I lean towards fixing it in 3.0.1 and 3.1.1. What do you guys think? I will take a close look into it tomorrow.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dajac","name":"dajac","key":"dajac","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"David Jacot","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich"},"created":"2022-01-18T17:54:44.792+0000","updated":"2022-01-18T17:55:28.638+0000"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17478308","id":"17478308","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"Since the memory leak issue: KAFKA-13597 is confirmed to be a bad dependency version for the interceptor, I think we don't have to fix this in v3.1.0. Thank you.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"2022-01-19T01:56:19.478+0000","updated":"2022-01-19T01:56:19.478+0000"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17478455","id":"17478455","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dajac","name":"dajac","key":"dajac","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"David Jacot","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich"},"body":"Sounds good. Thanks [~showuon].","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dajac","name":"dajac","key":"dajac","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"David Jacot","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich"},"created":"2022-01-19T09:09:03.808+0000","updated":"2022-01-19T09:09:03.808+0000"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17547803","id":"17547803","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=d-t-w","name":"d-t-w","key":"d-t-w","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667"},"displayName":"Derek Troy-West","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney"},"body":"This represents a breaking change where:\r\n # Broker version is < 2.8.0\r\n # Cluster has ACL configured, but no IDEMPOTENT_WRITE permission set\r\n # Producer has default configuration (or no config captured in KAFKA-13673)\r\n # Kafka Client library version is bumped to 3.2.0 in the producing application\r\n\r\nThe resulting production error has a ClusterAuthorizationException but it wasn't clear that a new ACL was required until we found KAFKA-13759.\r\n\r\nI think 1-3 might be quite a common scenario for Kafka users in the wild, and 4 is very easy to do on the application side.\r\n\r\nPerhaps it might be an idea to add a note to the 3.2.0 upgrade guide or release notes about this one.\r\n\r\nMore info: [https://kpow.io/articles/kafka-producer-breaking-change/]","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=d-t-w","name":"d-t-w","key":"d-t-w","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667"},"displayName":"Derek Troy-West","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney"},"created":"2022-06-04T02:01:39.134+0000","updated":"2022-06-04T02:02:04.405+0000"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17547813","id":"17547813","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"[~d-t-w] , yes, adding a note to notable changes in 3.2.0 section is a good idea. Are you interested in submitting a PR for it? Thanks.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"2022-06-04T02:51:41.709+0000","updated":"2022-06-04T02:51:41.709+0000"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17547818","id":"17547818","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=d-t-w","name":"d-t-w","key":"d-t-w","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667"},"displayName":"Derek Troy-West","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney"},"body":"Very happy to [~showuon] I will just copy points 1-4 into the notes if that's ok?\r\n\r\nI'll raise a PR later this afternoon. Should I raise that PR on the apache-site github repository?","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=d-t-w","name":"d-t-w","key":"d-t-w","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667"},"displayName":"Derek Troy-West","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney"},"created":"2022-06-04T03:28:52.027+0000","updated":"2022-06-04T03:28:52.027+0000"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17547916","id":"17547916","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"[~d-t-w] , let's open a PR to Kafka repo first, we can discuss how to phrase it there. And then open a PR to kafka-site after merged.\r\n\r\nFor the points 1-4, I'm thinking we should make it into a sentence.\r\n\r\nThis is the current note for v3.2.0 related to this issue:\r\n\r\n_Notable changes in 3.2.0_\r\n\r\n    _- Idempotence for the producer is enabled by default if no conflicting configurations are set. In 3.0.0 and 3.1.0, a bug prevented this default from being applied, which meant that idempotence remained disabled unless the user had explicitly set enable.idempotence to true (See KAFKA-13598 for more details). This issue was fixed and the default is properly applied in 3.0.1, 3.1.1, and 3.2.0._\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nI'm thinking you can add a sub-bullet after it, ex:\r\n\r\n_Notable changes in 3.2.0_\r\n\r\n    _- Idempotence for the producer is enabled by default if no conflicting configurations are set. In 3.0.0 and 3.1.0, a bug prevented this default from being applied, which meant that idempotence remained disabled unless the user had explicitly set enable.idempotence to true (See KAFKA-13598 for more details). This issue was fixed and the default is properly applied in 3.0.1, 3.1.1, and 3.2.0._\r\n\r\n           _-- When the broker version is lower than 2.8.0, and the client version is_ _3.0.1, 3.1.1, and later, the IDEMPOTENT_WRITE permission is required to produce data._\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSomething like that. Again, we can discuss it in the PR. Thank you.\r\n\r\n ","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"2022-06-04T06:45:55.394+0000","updated":"2022-06-04T06:45:55.394+0000"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17550736","id":"17550736","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=d-t-w","name":"d-t-w","key":"d-t-w","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667"},"displayName":"Derek Troy-West","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney"},"body":"Thanks Luke, I raised [https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/12260]","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=d-t-w","name":"d-t-w","key":"d-t-w","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667"},"displayName":"Derek Troy-West","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney"},"created":"2022-06-07T01:23:11.951+0000","updated":"2022-06-07T01:23:11.951+0000"}],"maxResults":9,"total":9,"startAt":0},"status":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/status/5","description":"A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png","name":"Resolved","id":"5","statusCategory":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/statuscategory/3","id":3,"key":"done","colorName":"green","name":"Done"}}},"renderedFields":{"summary":null,"resolutiondate":"07/Feb/22 17:58","created":"18/Jan/22 08:53","description":"<p>In <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-10619\" title=\"Enable producer idempotence by default (KIP-679)\" class=\"issue-link\" data-issue-key=\"KAFKA-10619\"><del>KAFKA-10619</del></a>, we intended to enable idempotence by default, but this was not achieved due to a bug in the config validation logic. The change from acks=1 to acks=all worked correctly, however.</p>\n\n<p>This is the following up for KIP-679: <a href=\"https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-679%3A+Producer+will+enable+the+strongest+delivery+guarantee+by+default\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-679%3A+Producer+will+enable+the+strongest+delivery+guarantee+by+default</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>Note: In <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-13673\" title=\"disable idempotent producer when acks/retries/max.in.flight config conflicts\" class=\"issue-link\" data-issue-key=\"KAFKA-13673\"><del>KAFKA-13673</del></a>, we'll disable idempotent producer when acks/retries/max.in.flight config conflicts, to avoid breaking existing producers.</p>","issuelinks":null,"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17477963","id":"17477963","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ijuma","name":"ijuma","key":"ijuma","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Ismael Juma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=showuon\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"showuon\">showuon</a> it would be good to determine if this is a 3.1.0 blocker. cc <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dajac\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"dajac\">dajac</a> <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kirktrue\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"kirktrue\">kirktrue</a></p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ijuma","name":"ijuma","key":"ijuma","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Ismael Juma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"created":"18/Jan/22 15:13","updated":"18/Jan/22 15:13"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17478086","id":"17478086","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dajac","name":"dajac","key":"dajac","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"David Jacot","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich"},"body":"<p>That seems to be a bug and not a regression introduced in 3.1 so I lean towards fixing it in 3.0.1 and 3.1.1. What do you guys think? I will take a close look into it tomorrow.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dajac","name":"dajac","key":"dajac","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"David Jacot","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich"},"created":"18/Jan/22 17:54","updated":"18/Jan/22 17:55"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17478308","id":"17478308","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p>Since the memory leak issue: <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-13597\" title=\"Memory leak with kafka-clients 3.0.0\" class=\"issue-link\" data-issue-key=\"KAFKA-13597\"><del>KAFKA-13597</del></a> is confirmed to be a bad dependency version for the interceptor, I think we don't have to fix this in v3.1.0. Thank you.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"19/Jan/22 01:56","updated":"19/Jan/22 01:56"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17478455","id":"17478455","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dajac","name":"dajac","key":"dajac","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"David Jacot","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich"},"body":"<p>Sounds good. Thanks <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=showuon\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"showuon\">showuon</a>.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dajac","name":"dajac","key":"dajac","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"David Jacot","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich"},"created":"19/Jan/22 09:09","updated":"19/Jan/22 09:09"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17547803","id":"17547803","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=d-t-w","name":"d-t-w","key":"d-t-w","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667"},"displayName":"Derek Troy-West","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney"},"body":"<p>This represents a breaking change where:</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Broker version is &lt; 2.8.0</li>\n\t<li>Cluster has ACL configured, but no IDEMPOTENT_WRITE permission set</li>\n\t<li>Producer has default configuration (or no config captured in <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-13673\" title=\"disable idempotent producer when acks/retries/max.in.flight config conflicts\" class=\"issue-link\" data-issue-key=\"KAFKA-13673\"><del>KAFKA-13673</del></a>)</li>\n\t<li>Kafka Client library version is bumped to 3.2.0 in the producing application</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p>The resulting production error has a ClusterAuthorizationException but it wasn't clear that a new ACL was required until we found <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-13759\" title=\"Disable producer idempotence by default in producers instantiated by Connect\" class=\"issue-link\" data-issue-key=\"KAFKA-13759\"><del>KAFKA-13759</del></a>.</p>\n\n<p>I think 1-3 might be quite a common scenario for Kafka users in the wild, and 4 is very easy to do on the application side.</p>\n\n<p>Perhaps it might be an idea to add a note to the 3.2.0 upgrade guide or release notes about this one.</p>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://kpow.io/articles/kafka-producer-breaking-change/\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://kpow.io/articles/kafka-producer-breaking-change/</a></p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=d-t-w","name":"d-t-w","key":"d-t-w","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667"},"displayName":"Derek Troy-West","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney"},"created":"04/Jun/22 02:01","updated":"04/Jun/22 02:02"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17547813","id":"17547813","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=d-t-w\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"d-t-w\">d-t-w</a> , yes, adding a note to notable changes in 3.2.0 section is a good idea. Are you interested in submitting a PR for it? Thanks.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"04/Jun/22 02:51","updated":"04/Jun/22 02:51"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17547818","id":"17547818","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=d-t-w","name":"d-t-w","key":"d-t-w","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667"},"displayName":"Derek Troy-West","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney"},"body":"<p>Very happy to <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=showuon\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"showuon\">showuon</a> I will just copy points 1-4 into the notes if that's ok?</p>\n\n<p>I'll raise a PR later this afternoon. Should I raise that PR on the apache-site github repository?</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=d-t-w","name":"d-t-w","key":"d-t-w","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667"},"displayName":"Derek Troy-West","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney"},"created":"04/Jun/22 03:28","updated":"04/Jun/22 03:28"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17547916","id":"17547916","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=d-t-w\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"d-t-w\">d-t-w</a> , let's open a PR to Kafka repo first, we can discuss how to phrase it there. And then open a PR to kafka-site after merged.</p>\n\n<p>For the points 1-4, I'm thinking we should make it into a sentence.</p>\n\n<p>This is the current note for v3.2.0 related to this issue:</p>\n\n<p><em>Notable changes in 3.2.0</em></p>\n\n<p>    <em>- Idempotence for the producer is enabled by default if no conflicting configurations are set. In 3.0.0 and 3.1.0, a bug prevented this default from being applied, which meant that idempotence remained disabled unless the user had explicitly set enable.idempotence to true (See <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-13598\" title=\"idempotence producer is not enabled by default if not set explicitly\" class=\"issue-link\" data-issue-key=\"KAFKA-13598\"><del>KAFKA-13598</del></a> for more details). This issue was fixed and the default is properly applied in 3.0.1, 3.1.1, and 3.2.0.</em></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>I'm thinking you can add a sub-bullet after it, ex:</p>\n\n<p><em>Notable changes in 3.2.0</em></p>\n\n<p>    <em>- Idempotence for the producer is enabled by default if no conflicting configurations are set. In 3.0.0 and 3.1.0, a bug prevented this default from being applied, which meant that idempotence remained disabled unless the user had explicitly set enable.idempotence to true (See <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-13598\" title=\"idempotence producer is not enabled by default if not set explicitly\" class=\"issue-link\" data-issue-key=\"KAFKA-13598\"><del>KAFKA-13598</del></a> for more details). This issue was fixed and the default is properly applied in 3.0.1, 3.1.1, and 3.2.0.</em></p>\n\n<p>           <em>-- When the broker version is lower than 2.8.0, and the client version is</em> <em>3.0.1, 3.1.1, and later, the IDEMPOTENT_WRITE permission is required to produce data.</em></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>Something like that. Again, we can discuss it in the PR. Thank you.</p>\n\n<p> </p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"04/Jun/22 06:45","updated":"04/Jun/22 06:45"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209/comment/17550736","id":"17550736","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=d-t-w","name":"d-t-w","key":"d-t-w","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667"},"displayName":"Derek Troy-West","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney"},"body":"<p>Thanks Luke, I raised <a href=\"https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/12260\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/12260</a></p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=d-t-w","name":"d-t-w","key":"d-t-w","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=d-t-w&avatarId=23667"},"displayName":"Derek Troy-West","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney"},"created":"07/Jun/22 01:23","updated":"07/Jun/22 01:23"}],"maxResults":9,"total":9,"startAt":0},"status":null}}